{"name": "Sophie: Starlight Whispers", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/532aea91374f50e3c8cba0ac32be5b87.webp?t=1773151215\" width=\"615\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Allow your magic to bloom!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sophie: Starlight Whispers</strong> is an adventure game with metroidvania elements, featuring pixelated graphics, a deep narrative, and fully dubbed in Portuguese. Explore a vast map and put an end to the dark creatures that terrorize the kingdom of Sharan.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FACE MONSTERS WITH REAL-TIME COMBAT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect up to 32 different spells and build your arsenal according to your play style;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect different weapons throughout the kingdom and add special upgrades;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight unique bosses and unravel the mystery behind the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/60df2bd5b477ce98f7c2c55ed7b349c7.poster.avif?t=1773151215\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/60df2bd5b477ce98f7c2c55ed7b349c7.webm?t=1773151215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/60df2bd5b477ce98f7c2c55ed7b349c7.mp4?t=1773151215\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/532aea91374f50e3c8cba0ac32be5b87.webp?t=1773151215\" width=\"615\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE A VAST WORLD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore interconnected areas and discover forests, ruins, hidden passages, and much more;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage with Sharan\u2019s universe and choose your own destiny. Follow the story, search for collectibles, complete side quests, and meet charismatic characters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy richly detailed pixel art with lighting and parallax effects that add dimension and immersion to the world;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chat with over 20 characters with original voices, all with hand-drawn stylized portraits;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect up to 37 Constellations to learn more about Sharan and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/fd7cc51ea97dffbe0b99f900dbe6d35e.poster.avif?t=1773151215\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/fd7cc51ea97dffbe0b99f900dbe6d35e.webm?t=1773151215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/fd7cc51ea97dffbe0b99f900dbe6d35e.mp4?t=1773151215\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/532aea91374f50e3c8cba0ac32be5b87.webp?t=1773151215\" width=\"615\"/></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HAVE YOU EVER WISHED YOU COULD FLY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each area of <strong>\u200b\u200bSophie: Starlight Whispers</strong> is carefully designed to be unique, engaging, and challenging. Filled with peculiar creatures, the world of Sharan shines with life and mystery, inviting the player to lose themselves in this deep, philosophical, and delicate story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The responsive gameplay, combined with attractive graphics and an impactful soundtrack, transports the player into Sharan, prompting them to discover more of these secrets. End the shadows and free Sharan from the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/70c3bf06e500c203e6f98793b2552239.poster.avif?t=1773151215\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/70c3bf06e500c203e6f98793b2552239.webm?t=1773151215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/70c3bf06e500c203e6f98793b2552239.mp4?t=1773151215\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562140/extras/532aea91374f50e3c8cba0ac32be5b87.webp?t=1773151215\" width=\"615\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Join Sophie on this adventure with deep storytelling and immersive graphics. Battle against monsters, explore the universe, unlock new spells, and discover why being different can be a superpo